// An equation followed by ";" (or "seq") is sequenced before the next one. With sequential equations a
// variable may be written several times and read in between, like statements. (KIELER also warns
// "ValuedObject with name _St44Seq_local_seq0 is contained in the model but not in VariableStore.")
scchart St44Seq {
  input int I
  output int X
  dataflow {
    X = I;
    X = X * 10;
    X = X + 1
  }
}
